s="min-h-screen"><div class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen w-full max-w-7xl flex-col px-4 pt-6 lg:px-10"><a class="fixed top-3 left-3 z-50 -translate-y-20 rounded-md bg-neutral-900 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-transform focus-visible:translate-y-0 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:bg-neutral-100 dark:text-black dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="relative z-10 m-0 p-0"><div class="flex min-h-9 items-center justify-between gap-2 sm:gap-4"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2 overflow-hidden"><a aria-label="Vercel" class="inline-flex shrink-0 text-inherit no-underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400" title="Made with love by Vercel" href="https://vercel.com"><svg aria-hidden="true" height="18" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="18"><path d="M8 1L16 15H0L8 1Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></a><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-600"><svg height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16"><path d="M4.01526 15.3939L4.3107 14.7046L10.3107 0.704556L10.6061 0.0151978L11.9849 0.606077L11.6894 1.29544L5.68942 15.2954L5.39398 15.9848L4.01526 15.3939Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><a aria-label="Is Agentic home" class="truncate font-pixel text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-inherit no-underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400" href="/">Is Agentic</a></div><button aria-label="Copy command: npx is-agentic" class="group ml-auto hidden h-9 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-3 text-left transition-colors hover:border-neutral-300 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 sm:flex dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950 dark:hover:border-neutral-600 dark:hover:bg-neutral-900 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400" type="button"><code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-600">$<!-- --> </span>npx is-agentic<!-- --> <span class="text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">[domain]</span></code><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-neutral-400 transition-colors group-hover:text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-600 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-300"><svg fill="none" height="16" viewBox="0 0 18 18" width="16"><rect height="9.5" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" width="9.5" x="6" y="6"></rect><path d="M12 6V4a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5h-6A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 3 4v6A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 4.5 11H6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span></button></div></header><main id="main" class="flex-1 py-16"><article class="grid max-w-3xl gap-12"><header class="grid gap-4"><h1 class="m-0 text-balance text-4xl leading-tight font-medium tracking-tighter">Methodology</h1><p class="m-0 max-w-2xl text-pretty text-lg text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">What an Is Agentic score measures, where the data comes from, and how to interpret a report.</p></header><div class="grid gap-10 leading-7"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"TechArticle","@id":"https://is-agentic.com/methodology","url":"https://is-agentic.com/methodology","name":"Methodology","headline":"Methodology","description":"What an Is Agentic score measures, where the data comes from, and how to interpret a report.","inLanguage":"en","about":{"@id":"https://is-agentic.com/#application"},"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://is-agentic.com/#website"},"author":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://is-agentic.com/#organization","name":"Vercel Inc."},"publisher":{"@id":"https://is-agentic.com/#organization"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://is-agentic.com/methodology#breadcrumb"}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://is-agentic.com/methodology#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Is Agentic","item":"https://is-agentic.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Methodology"}]}]}</script><section class="grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3"><h2 class="m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">What the score represents</h2><div class="grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"><p class="m-0">Is Agentic estimates how readily AI agents can discover, access, understand, and use a public website. Every check is run and scored by Ora. Is Agentic groups those checks by maturity and applicability to produce the score shown here, so checks that do not apply to a site do not count against it. The score is an at-a-glance summary; the individual checks and evidence are the useful part of the report.</p></div></section><section class="grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3"><h2 class="m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">Scoring model</h2><div class="grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"><p class="m-0">Essential checks share an 80-point pool and recommended checks share a 20-point pool. Emerging signals can add a small bonus, capped at five points, without becoming requirements. Not-applicable checks are excluded, partial results receive proportional credit, and duplicated check IDs across MCP surfaces are averaged. API, OAuth, MCP, GraphQL, and MCP Apps checks activate only when that surface is positively identified.</p></div></section><section class="grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3"><h2 class="m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">Data source</h2><div class="grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"><p class="m-0">Ora runs the scan and scores each layer, check, and recommendation. Is Agentic organizes those results into Essential, Recommended, and Bonus groups and adds a prioritized implementation prompt, observed agent journeys, public share pages, caching, and historical storage.</p><p class="m-0">Read Ora&#x27;s<!-- --> <a class="text-inherit underline decoration-neutral-400 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:decoration-neutral-600 dark:hover:decoration-neutral-100 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400" href="https://ora.ai/docs">API documentation</a> <!-- -->and<!-- --> <a class="text-inherit underline decoration-neutral-400 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:decoration-neutral-600 dark:hover:decoration-neutral-100 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400" href="https://ora.ai/methodology">methodology</a> <!-- -->for the current check definitions and scoring details.</p></div></section><section class="grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3"><h2 class="m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">Freshness and history</h2><div class="grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"><p class="m-0">A report shows its scan timestamp. Completed scans are cached for fast retrieval. When a score is requested, Ora may return a complete result from its six-hour freshness cache without running another scan. Is Agentic stores the latest completed result as a static public report, while snapshots may be retained for historical comparison. A score can change because the target changed, Ora&#x27;s methodology changed, or a time-sensitive check returned a different result.</p></div></section><section class="grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3"><h2 class="m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">Recommendations</h2><div class="grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"><p class="m-0">“Prompt to fix” converts all actionable recommendations returned by Ora into an implementation brief. The estimated gain, when present, is directional rather than guaranteed. Review evidence in context, implement changes safely, and rescan to verify the outcome.</p></div></section><section class="grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3"><h2 class="m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight">Limitations</h2><div class="grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300"><ul class="m-0 grid list-disc gap-2 pl-5"><li>Scans observe public behavior at a point in time.</li><li>Automated checks can produce false positives, false negatives, or partial results.</li><li>A high score is not a security, accessibility, quality, compliance, or compatibility certification.</li><li>A score does not imply affiliation with or endorsement of the scanned site.</li></ul></div></section></div></article></main><footer class="border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-400"><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-end gap-x-6 gap-y-7 lg:flex lg:items-center lg:gap-6"><p class="col-start-1 row-start-2 m-0 flex min-w-0 flex-wrap gap-x-1.5 leading-6 lg:order-1 lg:mr-auto"><span class="whitespace-nowrap">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Vercel.</span><span class="whitespace-nowrap">Powered by<!-- --> <a class="text-inherit underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:hover:text-neutral-100 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400" href="https://ora.ai" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">Ora</a>.</span></p><nav aria-label="Footer" class="col-span-2 row-start-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-base sm:grid-cols-3 lg:order-2 lg:flex lg:items-center lg:gap-5 lg:text-sm"><a class="w-fit text-inherit underline-offset-4 hover:text-neutral-900 hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:hover:text-neutral-100 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400" href="/about">About</a><a class="w-fit text-inherit underline-offset-4 hover:text-neutral-900 hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:hover:text-neutral-100 dark:f