"description\\\":\\\"What an Is Agentic score measures, where the data comes from, and how to interpret a report.\\\",\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"about\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://is-agentic.com/#application\\\"},\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://is-agentic.com/#website\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://is-agentic.com/#organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Vercel Inc.\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://is-agentic.com/#organization\\\"},\\\"breadcrumb\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://is-agentic.com/methodology#breadcrumb\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://is-agentic.com/methodology#breadcrumb\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Is Agentic\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://is-agentic.com/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Methodology\\\"}]}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"What the score represents\"}],\"$L1e\"]}],\"$L1f\",\"$L20\",\"$L21\",\"$L22\",\"$L23\"]}]]}]}],\"$L24\"]}]}],[\"$L25\"],\"$L26\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"11:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L27\",null,{\"children\":\"$L28\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$2a\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$L2b\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2m5bdkfc8ee9m.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2c:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/21v0dslobqgrc.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\nf:C\n16:300\n1e:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"Is Agentic estimates how readily AI agents can discover, access, understand, and use a public website. Every check is run and scored by Ora. Is Agentic groups those checks by maturity and applicability to produce the score shown here, so checks that do not apply to a site do not count against it. The score is an at-a-glance summary; the individual checks and evidence are the useful part of the report.\"}]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Scoring model\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"Essential checks share an 80-point pool and recommended checks share a 20-point pool. Emerging signals can add a small bonus, capped at five points, without becoming requirements. Not-applicable checks are excluded, partial results receive proportional credit, and duplicated check IDs across MCP surfaces are averaged. API, OAuth, MCP, GraphQL, and MCP Apps checks activate only when that surface is positively identified.\"}]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"20:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Data source\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"Ora runs the scan and scores each layer, check, and recommendation. Is Agentic organizes those results into Essential, Recommended, and Bonus groups and adds a prioritized implementation prompt, observed agent journeys, public share pages, caching, and historical storage.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[\"Read Ora's\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"text-inherit underline decoration-neutral-400 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:decoration-neutral-600 dark:hover:decoration-neutral-100 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400\",\"href\":\"https://ora.ai/docs\",\"children\":\"API documentation\"}],\" \",\"and\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"text-inherit underline decoration-neutral-400 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:decoration-neutral-600 dark:hover:decoration-neutral-100 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400\",\"href\":\"https://ora.ai/methodology\",\"children\":\"methodology\"}],\" \",\"for the current check definitions and scoring details.\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"21:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Freshness and history\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"A report shows its scan timestamp. Completed scans are cached for fast retrieval. When a score is requested, Ora may return a complete result from its six-hour freshness cache without running another scan. Is Agentic stores the latest completed result as a static public report, while snapshots may be retained for historical comparison. A score can change because the target changed, Ora's methodology changed, or a time-sensitive check returned a different result.\"}]}]]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Recommendations\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"“Prompt to fix” converts all actionable recommendations returned by Ora into an implementation brief. The estimated gain, when present, is directional rather than guaranteed. Review evidence in context, implement changes safely, and rescan to verify the outcome.\"}]}]]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Limitations\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 grid list-disc gap-2 pl-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Scans observe public behavior at a point in time.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Automated checks can produce false positives, false negatives, or partial results.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"A high score is not a security, accessibility, quality, compliance, or compatibility certification.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"A score does not imply affiliation with or endorsement of the scanned site.\"}]]}]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"24:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-neutral-200 py-8 text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-400\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-end gap-x-6 gap-y-7 lg:flex lg:items-center lg:gap-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"col-start-1 row-start-2 m-0 flex min-w-0 flex-wrap gap-x-1.5 leading-6 lg:order-1 lg:mr-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"whitespace-nowrap\",\"children\":[\"© \",202